NOTICE

The floor plans in this repository depict fictional places and well-known
buildings. They are original fan-art and illustrative drawings, authored from
publicly available information — descriptions, published articles, photographs
and the recollections of viewers — and are approximations made for
demonstration and educational purposes. They are not measured surveys,
construction documents, or reproductions of any architectural drawing.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any studio,
publisher, broadcaster, game developer, architect, or other rights holder. No
official logos, trademarks, service marks, or copyrighted artwork are used or
reproduced. Names of buildings, shows and games appear only nominatively, to
identify the subject of a drawing.

If you hold rights in a subject drawn here and would like an entry changed or
removed, please open an issue.
